    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">At a time when much of the world remained undiscovered from other civilizations there was a small island called Fair....</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Typing with Jester is a typing game with a 8-Bit Retro fourscale style. Imagine those classic handhelds had a keyboard and a game like this. Sounds awesome right? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What features are already in the game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 playable characters, a female and a male jester</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1/10 story levels with unique boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">endless mode with highscore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3/8 unlockable characters for endless mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Trading Cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Cloud </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SWAG </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What are the games plannd features? </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story about clowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 remaining story levels with unique boss encounters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 remaining unlockable characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~ 3000 words per supported language</p></li></ul>",
